{"4348580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SPLIT FPV: Drone Racing", "steam_appid": 4348580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4926890], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a732c58b4b4253663a0c0a3af1648b4b.avif?t=1787920793\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free realistic FPV simulator for pumping real drone control skills. Connect a real remote control, pick up a gamepad or keyboard and take off into the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics and controls are designed so that every movement reflects real experience. One wrong action - and you immediately understand where you made a mistake. Skills in working with turns, gas control, accuracy and orientation are developed with each flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/22d5191b51ddddacd936a02e335c87ec.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=104 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a8c975d48caccfea17c84b9b3c364c68.poster.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a8c975d48caccfea17c84b9b3c364c68.webm?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a8c975d48caccfea17c84b9b3c364c68.mp4?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game formats are available for training: free flight, several types of races, delivery, search and other tasks. All this takes place in large, detailed locations that allow you to hone your skills in different conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have various flight modes at your disposal: from the simplest to Acro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An end-to-end story campaign helps you not to get lost in the learning process. You study the world step by step, the capabilities of your drone and gradually reach a new level of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for those who want to experiment and find their own style, there is a full customization of the drone with the ability to assemble your own unique configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/6fa7331fa1580de1dab694793c371201.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/555a602c089f1074d547c670a6cb5030.poster.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/555a602c089f1074d547c670a6cb5030.webm?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/555a602c089f1074d547c670a6cb5030.mp4?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a732c58b4b4253663a0c0a3af1648b4b.avif?t=1787920793\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free realistic FPV simulator for pumping real drone control skills. Connect a real remote control, pick up a gamepad or keyboard and take off into the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics and controls are designed so that every movement reflects real experience. One wrong action - and you immediately understand where you made a mistake. Skills in working with turns, gas control, accuracy and orientation are developed with each flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/22d5191b51ddddacd936a02e335c87ec.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=104 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a8c975d48caccfea17c84b9b3c364c68.poster.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a8c975d48caccfea17c84b9b3c364c68.webm?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/a8c975d48caccfea17c84b9b3c364c68.mp4?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game formats are available for training: free flight, several types of races, delivery, search and other tasks. All this takes place in large, detailed locations that allow you to hone your skills in different conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have various flight modes at your disposal: from the simplest to Acro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An end-to-end story campaign helps you not to get lost in the learning process. You study the world step by step, the capabilities of your drone and gradually reach a new level of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for those who want to experiment and find their own style, there is a full customization of the drone with the ability to assemble your own unique configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/6fa7331fa1580de1dab694793c371201.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/555a602c089f1074d547c670a6cb5030.poster.avif?t=1787920793\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/555a602c089f1074d547c670a6cb5030.webm?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/extras/555a602c089f1074d547c670a6cb5030.mp4?t=1787920793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "SPLIT FPV is a detailed FPV drone control simulator with realistic flight physics and a drone customization system. Here you can learn to fly in a wide variety of flight modes and conditions. Explore the drone's design, experiment with the detailed customization system, and build your own drone.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/87521351f713c17d27ffdee2a152b938ae5e2129/header.jpg?t=1787920793", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/5fa3c887215ce686603ce01f2d4b45526bbd718d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787920793", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348580/5fa3c887215ce686603ce01f2d4b45526bbd718d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t